WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:02.229
(happy mellow dance music)
- [Host] There are 33,000

00:00:02.229 --> 00:00:04.542
traditional temples in Thailand.

00:00:04.542 --> 00:00:06.701
But with its majestic white exterior,

00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:09.951
Wat Rong Khun is anything but ordinary.

00:00:13.892 --> 00:00:16.283
Every part of Wat Rong Khun is unique.

00:00:16.283 --> 00:00:19.330
The entrance is lined with
ghoulish traffic cones,

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.192
ghostly heads hang from
trees, and arms reach up

00:00:22.192 --> 00:00:23.875
to meet you as you cross the bridge

00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:27.958
to this architecturally
curious place of worship.

00:00:29.427 --> 00:00:31.685
Wat Rong Khun's most
distinguishing feature

00:00:31.685 --> 00:00:33.553
is its untraditional white color,

00:00:33.553 --> 00:00:36.815
chosen by the artist to represent purity.

00:00:36.815 --> 00:00:39.328
The sprinkling of glass
mosaics are an emblem

00:00:39.328 --> 00:00:41.560
of enlightenment, while
the mirrors show off

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:45.727
Buddha's wisdom shining
through the universe.

00:00:45.804 --> 00:00:48.525
Contrasting the white is a gold building.

00:00:48.525 --> 00:00:51.262
The ornate restroom is
covered in gold leaf,

00:00:51.262 --> 00:00:54.191
symbolizing the idea of the
mind's fixation on wealth

00:00:54.191 --> 00:00:58.358
and material possessions.
(ding)

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:00.587
While the temple is visually stunning

00:01:00.587 --> 00:01:03.112
and attracts thousands of
tourists from around the world,

00:01:03.112 --> 00:01:06.378
when it was first completed,
it received negative attention.

00:01:06.378 --> 00:01:08.482
The Thai government,
monks, and other artists

00:01:08.482 --> 00:01:11.176
said it wasn't Thai art,
as it was a departure

00:01:11.176 --> 00:01:13.044
from the traditional due to the symbols

00:01:13.044 --> 00:01:17.162
embracing pop culture found
throughout the grounds.

00:01:17.162 --> 00:01:19.526
Despite that, the
building stands defiantly

00:01:19.526 --> 00:01:23.193
as an emblem of Thai
art for a modern world.

00:01:25.225 --> 00:01:27.642
(sonic ding)

